category: Net
requires: cygwin libidzebra2.0_0 libyaz5 perl_base
sdesc: "High-performance, structured text indexing and retrival engine (utilities)"
ldesc: "Zebra is a high-performance, general-purpose structured text indexing and
retrieval engine. It reads structured records in a variety of input formats
(eg. email, XML, MARC) and allows access to them through exact boolean search
expressions and relevance-ranked free-text queries."

